  # and vpn logged SEND FAILED every 10-minute cycle from 23:01Z while the paste had in fact landed.
  # Geometry is not decoration here: it IS the second half of the bug, measured 2026-07-25T00:30Z by
  # pasting a real '/xprobe-render' into vpn's pane (rendered line 15 of a 28-line capture) and running
